  "why": "A toy nuclear power plant on a concrete pad in a yard, built left to right: a glass reactor vessel with fuel rods in water, a steam pipe to a turbine, a generator with a lamp, a cooling tower, and finally a concrete dome. The camera opens close on the rods in the water, follows the steam to the turbine in mid shots, and ends wide on the finished plant.",
  "story": {
   "title": "How a nuclear power plant works",
   "hero": "a nuclear power plant",
